    "explanation" : "## function-result-limit\n\n_Description_: Functions returning too many results can be hard to understand/use.\n\n_Configuration_: (int) the maximum allowed return values\n\nExample:\n\n```toml\n[rule.function-result-limit]\narguments = [3]\n```",
